  "description": "EppLib.NET provides a library that makes easy for registrars to interact with registries implementing the Extensible Provisioning Protocol (EPP). Includes extensions for CIRA (.CA), Nominet (.UK), IIS (.SE), Verisign Namestore, LaunchPhase and SecDNS.",
