  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "HostInfoResponse.Host is now public, so host info responses can be read. DomainTransferResponse reads exDate (it looked for expDate, so ExpirationDate was always null) and the transfer status, requesting and acting clients and dates. Name servers can be sent as host attributes (hostAttr, with glue addresses) through DomainCreate.NameServerAttributes and EppDomainUpdateAddRemove.NameServerAttributes, and are returned in Domain.NameServerAttributes. PollResponse.DomainName is filled from standard domain notifications and IIS notifications. Thanks to the Esselink-nu and NoorDigitalAgency forks, which found these gaps.",
